{
  "$comment": "Env vars mounted into Cloud Run john-bogle-ui (the API behind app.ferni.ai). Secret name defaults to the env name in kebab-case; 'secrets' overrides it. Required secrets fail the deploy when missing; optional ones are mounted when they exist in Secret Manager and reported when they don't. Consumed by scripts/deploy/resolve-secrets.mjs (CLI `ferni deploy ui` and deploy-production.yml).",
